Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:35:56 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Esc: storage-aware upper bound (fractional knapsack),
 tests; apply storage fix patch

The simulated greedy now obeys budget_MB (teammate's patch). With a storage
budget the bound is also capped by the fractional knapsack bound, so Esc can
stop when storage, not the index count, limits the search.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CjHr7mFBfqBd1hBxcjucKr
